---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = 'Privacy Policy';
const description = 'How Trading Yantra collects, uses, and protects the information you share with us.';
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-20 lg:px-8">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: September 2026</p>

    <div class="prose-invert mt-10 space-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
      <p>
        This policy explains what information Trading Yantra collects through this website and how
        it is used. It applies to this marketing website; the Trading Yantra product itself will
        have its own, more detailed privacy policy once available.
      </p>

      <h2 class="pt-4 text-lg font-bold text-white">Information you provide</h2>
      <p>
        When you submit the contact form, we collect the name, email address, phone number (if
        provided), and message content you enter. This is used solely to respond to your enquiry
        and, if you request it, to follow up about early access to the product. We do not sell this
        information.
      </p>

      <h2 class="pt-4 text-lg font-bold text-white">Form processing</h2>
      <p>
        Contact form submissions are relayed via a third-party form service (Web3Forms) that
        delivers the message to our inbox. That provider processes the submitted fields solely to
        deliver the message and does not appear as a separate tracker on this site.
      </p>

      <h2 class="pt-4 text-lg font-bold text-white">Cookies & analytics</h2>
      <p>
        This website does not set advertising or tracking cookies. Fonts are loaded from Google
        Fonts, which may log standard request metadata (such as IP address) as part of serving the
        font files — no Trading Yantra account or profile data is attached to that request. If we
        add privacy-respecting analytics in the future, this policy will be updated first.
      </p>

      <h2 class="pt-4 text-lg font-bold text-white">Data retention</h2>
      <p>
        Contact form submissions are retained only as long as needed to respond to your enquiry and
        for reasonable record-keeping, after which they may be deleted.
      </p>

      <h2 class="pt-4 text-lg font-bold text-white">Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        You can ask us to access, correct, or delete any personal information you've submitted to
        us by emailing
        <a href="mailto:hello@tradingyantra.in" class="text-teal-300 underline hover:text-teal-200">hello@tradingyantra.in</a>.
        We will respond within a reasonable time.
      </p>

      <h2 class="pt-4 text-lg font-bold text-white">Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this policy as the product evolves. Material changes will be reflected by
        updating the "Last updated" date above.
      </p>

      <p class="pt-4 text-slate-400">
        Questions? Contact us at
        <a href="mailto:hello@tradingyantra.in" class="text-teal-300 underline hover:text-teal-200">hello@tradingyantra.in</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
